WEBVTT

00:07:28.580 --> 00:07:32.705
and you could be a super extrovert
who is shy in new situations.

00:07:32.729 --> 00:07:37.682
So, shyness is about
the fear of social judgment.

00:07:37.706 --> 00:07:40.952
So if you're going out on the ice
and everybody's watching you,

00:07:40.976 --> 00:07:46.918
you're feeling an acutely,
painfully heightened self-consciousness.

00:07:46.942 --> 00:07:51.102
And then later on in life it would show up
in job interviews and things like that.

00:07:51.126 --> 00:07:57.713
And introversion is much more about
the preference for environments

00:07:57.737 --> 00:08:00.702
where there's just a little less going on,